AUDIO: 'I just used the Elejoy vehicle to home inverter to power my house completely off-rid from an electric car. Here\'s how. First, turn off the house main breaker to the grid. Slide the interlock and turn on the backup power breaker.'

[00:15] [scene:talk]
VISUAL: 
AUDIO: 'Then, plug in the generator cable into the bottom of the inverter and the other end into the backup power inlet.'

[00:27] [scene:talk]
VISUAL: 
AUDIO: 'Open the cabinet door. Turn on the breakers and press the power button.'

[00:39] [scene:talk]
VISUAL: 
AUDIO: 'You\'ll see the screen turn on. Then plug the cable into the electric car. Wait a moment and the V2 starts powering the entire home. You\'ll see'

[00:51] [scene:talk]
VISUAL: 
